{"id":"f088119b0602bcd0","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-predicate-expression.md","title":"固定结构中的无参数一元可定义性","display":"df-predicate-expression — 固定结构中的无参数一元可定义性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-predicate-expression","aliases":["91-df-predicate-expression","91-df-truth-expression","91-df-expressibility"],"display":"df-predicate-expression — 固定结构中的无参数一元可定义性","depends_on":["[[91-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-predicate-expression"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-predicate-expression</span><span>91-df-truth-expression</span><span>91-df-expressibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-predicate-expression — 固定结构中的无参数一元可定义性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8e718c83a9cc331\" href=\"?note=c8e718c83a9cc331\" title=\"91-df-structure\">91-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|\">\\(P\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 的候选定义仅以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 自由，不含外加参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredExpr}_{\\mathfrak M}\">\\(\\mathrm{PredExpr}_{\\mathfrak M}\\)</span> 为下述可定义性谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}expression}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{PredExpr}_{\\mathfrak M}(P,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\,[a\\in P\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[x\\mapsto a]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}expression}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{PredExpr}_{\\mathfrak M}(P,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\,[a\\in P\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[x\\mapsto a]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若允许参数，需要把参数元组列为另一个环境并使用对应命名语言；不能从这个无参数定义直接推得带参数版本。\n加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的语言确实能用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(x)\">\\(T(x)\\)</span> 定义其实际解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathfrak M}\">\\(T^{\\mathfrak M}\\)</span>；只有解释已正确时，它才定义基础算术真理。旧表格对任意真理扩张都写“完全真理可表达”，遗漏了语义充分性前提。\n只有旧语言显式定义且不另加新的内容公理时，定义扩张才自动保守。</p>\n<p>来源：§4 关于定义和公理化的区别；固定模型可定义性的标准展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c8e718c83a9cc331","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-structure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredExpr}_{\\mathfrak M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}expression}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{PredExpr}_{\\mathfrak M}(P,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\,[a\\in P\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[x\\mapsto a]].","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathfrak M}","display":false}],"bytes":1541,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-predicate-expression]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-iterative-construction.md]]\n[[91-df-jump-operator.md]]\n[[91-df-l